{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "3ccc4d3a55c58267318fc02361401ae2bd6eb9c7f5f4ef8b6d1bb5fbef59e931", "ja": "ふたりの時間", "zh": "两人的时间", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7efede8bf3574bafe4b2732eb93899a95f5abcade8262256885af5de22dff0f1", "ja": "新曲のレッスンや、休み時間のふれあいを通\nじて、絆を深めていく可憐と律子。律子に任\nせて正解だったと言うプロデューサーに、律\n子は話したい事があると切り出す。", "zh": "可怜和律子通过新歌练习以及休息时间的交流，逐渐加深着彼此的羁绊。制作人说，把这件事交给律子果然没错，律子便开口说自己有话想谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "39331e2eb49ceeea9c14e4d23907a332d3485c775733ddcd0162eedf70229081", "ja": "（今日は律子と可憐、ふたりだけの新曲レッスンだ。\n地方公演のレッスンと平行だけど……）", "zh": "（今天是律子和可怜两个人一起上新歌的课。虽然要和地方公演的课程同时进行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "200b797f233e3dfd8ffe8dd42206509ed631363f1afa4272620f2db057934693", "ja": "1、2、3、4！　\nポーズで止まる！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！ \n姿势定格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "7ded06bb577544e481fe10e52ce26c7c0ea8eb8076887e567b1f224195e9c42a", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……！\nぽ、ポーズで……止まるっ！", "zh": "呼、呼……！\n要、要摆出姿势……停下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "6d71b0fc1b590cffcdf0ffe8df9f216261df47c29bf162968f489e46231c9e86", "ja": "うん、いいじゃない。その調子よ、可憐！\n今のは軸もブレてないし、堂々としてて良かったわ！", "zh": "嗯，不错，就是这个状态，可怜！\n刚才的动作重心也很稳，而且表现得很大方，很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "cda48b97764cf5efe319c68a4c60695682713d0b028d7b87bf1efe2b758dc210", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……り、律子さんの、おかげです……。\n丁寧に、アドバイスしてくれたから……。", "zh": "呼、呼……这、这都多亏了律子小姐……  \n因为您耐心地给了我建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "f761253011735351d3d47961dedb17e7d2069b3390348e5dba75f543dce01923", "ja": "私はただ、アドバイスをしただけよ。\n頑張ったのは可憐だってこと、忘れないで。", "zh": "我只是给了些建议而已。别忘了，努力的是可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "d69244c453da2cedac94c8780b3adb5d24d1b789645924d5abf51c7e71a69c22", "ja": "は、はい……てへへ……♪", "zh": "好、好的……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f56db095a8cbd7b7aee880f8587956e54363d2595c498928d01b8df5bda80092", "ja": "（律子と可憐……意外だけど、案外\nいい組み合わせだったのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（律子和可怜……虽然有点出乎意料，但说不定意外地是个不错的组合……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1885e9507e3b161f95ecd1dc1195e40705cb15174e595a4c002c3a27eb628eff", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま！　かなり進んだし、\n今日はここまでにしよう。しっかり体を休めてくれ！", "zh": "你们两个，辛苦了！进展得相当顺利，今天就先到这里吧。好好休息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "c28effa80b1ef8b8ba7cd108fdca1cfbb8c200736fbd69bcce5899b01c08a693", "ja": "はいっ……！", "zh": "是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "38bd6b9fc961cfcb0e64e19be4eb92a494c2f3377db9f535565dedf3226b6854", "ja": "（あ、律子さん……まだ、帰ってなかったんだ……。\n本、読んでるみたいだけど……何の本なのかな……？）", "zh": "（啊，律子小姐……原来还没回去啊……。好像在看书……不知道是什么书呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "97619d792a2770c5da7b50553e72337bdf81be9c166cf8907bd5bc982e080495", "ja": "（声を、かけてみようかな……。\nでも……じ、邪魔しちゃうかな……うぅ……）", "zh": "（要不要试着打个招呼呢……\n可是……会、会不会打扰到她啊……呜呜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "5f5fcd3ef32ad758254f7f53bfa6551a38158ca5cf29032fc3b4b093205a5c1d", "ja": "ふぅ。可憐、どうしたの？\nさっきから、うろうろして。", "zh": "呼……可怜，你怎么了？\n从刚才开始就一直在这儿走来走去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "0404e0d9702c96294c5139901ac6dd46985f419d71592184903756eed08a85e0", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？\nあ、あの……き、気づいてたんですか……？", "zh": "呀啊！？\n那、那个……您、您注意到了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "91ffd4b5aa76fbcc593115f22ae651cf677ce9c6b6393cd890d0725a8dccea09", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。可憐が近くにいると、なんだか\nいい香りがするんだもの。今日は何をつけてるの？", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。可怜在附近的时候，总会闻到一股好香的味道。今天喷的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "380111adbe18f7cc3979814edaa70af135202c7de2a285268fcc229af0d286a0", "ja": "あ、え、ええと……\nローズマリー……です……。", "zh": "啊，这、这个……\n是迷迭香……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "d60a45b0944a6d3a67b22948aa33231d1c0587b972d75b53d67bb7bab560b21f", "ja": "ローズマリーって、料理とかに使う？\nスーッとした香り……アロマにも使ったりするのね。", "zh": "迷迭香是用来做菜的吗？\n那股清爽的香气……也会用来做芳香疗法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "9c250241f5ddbd85d3c1ecaf5f14ed48985a805ad61b85e0dacb5066f5642bbd", "ja": "は、はい、そうなんです……。ローズマリーは、\n自信が出る香りとも、言われてるんですよ……。", "zh": "是、是的……迷迭香据说也是一种能让人找回自信的香气……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "282a195c528ca4cf660791fb252a502ca2c5800d52aa808e88572852becce49a", "ja": "なるほどね。可憐が最近調子がいいのは、\nそのアロマのおかげかしら？", "zh": "原来如此。可怜最近状态这么好，\n难道是多亏了那种香薰吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "3f4caf4af4d5f4183ad82ce96d04d2cb3cd545a8cff23f5fad521a823b5a966a", "ja": "そ、それは、香りというか、律子さんのおかげで……。\nあの……ど、読書の、邪魔じゃないですか……？", "zh": "那、那个，与其说是香味，不如说是多亏了律子小姐……  \n那、那个……没有打扰您读书吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "bd952babf6618bdf3669147b32e3b14c2403c06817e6158d318e1623ce763439", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫よ。\nちょっと休憩しようかと思ってたところだから。", "zh": "没事，没关系的。\n我正想着稍微休息一下呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "1a89d3ae029c0b5e5783119d434edb83c934730878a57a39bc281c8b503a4a64", "ja": "あ……えっと……。な、何の本を読んでたか、\n聞いてもいいですか……？", "zh": "啊……那个……可以、可以问一下你刚才在读什么书吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "22b498db95d18ac19907505212b51ed537273ed6603d818ee2c30a7805b4f84a", "ja": "これ？　ただの恋愛小説よ。\n今回の新曲は恋の歌だし、ま、研究ってとこかしら。", "zh": "这个？只是普通的恋爱小说。\n这次的新歌是首恋爱歌曲，算是……做做研究吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "2292ec2f13fc1ef2ef80eab22c95b198175b435c6c0476131a44723b6ad0feca", "ja": "け、研究……！？　さ、さすが……。\n私も、見習わなきゃ……。", "zh": "研、研究……！？不、不愧是……  \n我也得向您学习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "141983793f386c3e7fc78b4cd33e73737e892db05d477aa1151aa10123716f10", "ja": "あの……り、律子さんは、こ、恋とか……\nしたこと、あるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "那个……律、律子小姐，谈、谈过恋爱……\n之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "dd8a2d4bee4cd7396eaeae9ea478bc7380abef9824aaba1525dbe1d304e6b956", "ja": "え！？　な、ないない！　ない……と、思うけど……。\nそ、そういう可憐はどうなのよ？", "zh": "诶！？没、没有没有！应该……没、没有过吧……大概。\n那、那个，可怜你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "06cdd37c608ceab69e030a709112d7780ec1b09fac5b1344935029fb93a23713", "ja": "わ、私！？　わ、私は、恋だなんて……\nそんな心の余裕、ないです……。", "zh": "我、我！？　我、我才没有恋爱什么的……\n哪有那种心思……我、我没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "3cfbc70d84dafd8ca4425472c609a4a35353a9cbb8c72b0eb99d81470a0212a1", "ja": "心の余裕……たしかにね。\n私たちはアイドルだし、やることがあるものね。", "zh": "从容的心境……确实呢。\n毕竟我们是偶像，还有该做的事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "3a8cdcb2152bebb5356e08889529695b9adcb23ca3268ddab5672563b19a180a", "ja": "そ、そう、ですよね……。\nうぅ……。", "zh": "是、是这样呢……  \n呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "3faff5af025fa79d45050106fc558a91b616c2d1c06795b9ade2140f82860d12", "ja": "でも、アイドルだから恋愛に興味を持っちゃいけない\nってこともないわよ？　こうして必要な時もあるし！", "zh": "不过，也不是说因为是偶像，就不能对恋爱感兴趣吧？像这样，有时候也是有必要的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "04c9e7defc66388425558f805a6f401cb7004ddba2745838c352fbba18598874", "ja": "私も、研究なんてちょっとカッコよく言ってみたけど。\n本当は単に好きなのよ、こういう小説が。ふふっ！", "zh": "我也只是把它说得好听点，叫作研究而已。其实单纯就是喜欢这类小说。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "b0e73fe7178902894f828658b3339f1634b7089ac15410c398a710a4c2d93326", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうなんですか？\nちょっと、意外……ああっ、ご、ごめんなさい！", "zh": "诶……原、原来是这样吗？\n有点意外……啊啊，对、对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "b21a2df44b61e3495c0952fa259e413e6f3b6d147a5ada64cdb064f8722575c0", "ja": "あはっ、いいのよ！　自分でもそう思うもの。\nそれよりこの本、可憐も読んでみる？　面白いわよ！", "zh": "啊哈哈，没关系的！我自己也这么觉得。\n比起这个，可怜要不要也看看这本书？很有意思哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1035_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a11e2628469b81c3c7c8cdfa68315f33ff0789da6601650cf6e24c17750f48cd", "ja": "（ん？　あそこにいるのは……律子と可憐か。\n最近、よく一緒にいるみたいだな）", "zh": "（嗯？　那边的是……律子和可怜吗。\n她们最近好像经常待在一起啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "09af9d6c57aa0b780c74fc8eb44900d66683622eaedabcab11dce1f923fb5dc6", "ja": "おーい、律子。お疲れさま。", "zh": "喂，律子。辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "bc2975ea795fe0b4a68969bf02338c20b9cc2048284011d2a025e859bb933024", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n今日は仕事、大丈夫なんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n今天的工作没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "022016153e17f40a430ff26987092de4263bd863ba0e26188409037635b6335c", "ja": "う、うん。今度は溜めないようにするよ……。\nところで律子、可憐と何をしてたんだ？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。下次我会注意不再积压工作……话说回来，律子，你刚才和可怜在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "866e812a4e798de39b2fa76fc1d1f60e8e5ac914e5e751914a81685f4ad63909", "ja": "可憐が、本に挟むしおりをくれたんです。\n私が本を読んでる時に話しかけちゃったからって。", "zh": "可怜送了我夹在书里的书签。\n说是之前在我看书的时候跟我搭话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "4f3c22da8d4dec3dd8c25098ceb87674623d61670485aeeab1b0cb2f14fda297", "ja": "気にしなくていいって言ったら、「なら、いつも\nレッスン見てもらっているお礼に」ですって。", "zh": "我说不用放在心上，她却说：“那就当作是对你平时指导我练习的谢礼吧。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "04233f8f6b761c7e4092d3f7a0da0112e38fbdad0698b1d011bb83bf9773d45a", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nいい香りがするのは、そのしおりか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n散发香味的就是那个书签吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "6eb831c97bf687c2f3c1dbdbd488907aedc56cc670c38e46ced9f2fbc43a3f76", "ja": "ええ。{$P$}、知ってますか？\nこれ、ローズマリーの香りなんですよ。", "zh": "嗯。{$P$}，你知道吗？\n这是迷迭香的香味哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1044_009rit", "source_sha256": "236c787f5eaf02571797040ddbe5c84f7d62dd166e0478d6948f26b0c52dba8a", "ja": "この前、私が「いい香りね」って言ったからかしら。\nほんと可憐って、周りに気を遣う子ですよね……。", "zh": "也许是因为前阵子我说了句“真香啊”吧。\n可怜真是个会顾虑周围人的孩子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d13d71121c7a2bcfd3253fd54b4a107735a90bfdd3d5f33e8a7ab5e781dc9885", "ja": "ああ。でも最近は、随分明るくなってきた気がするよ。\n律子に任せて正解だったな。", "zh": "啊。不过我觉得她最近开朗了许多。\n交给律子果然没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1046_009rit", "source_sha256": "55fc2616e07efa5971cca4ff2fc1e067ae34992dff7e97c7b0465bf49418edd5", "ja": "私は何も……あ、そうだ、{$P$}。\nちょっと話したいことがあるんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "我什么也没……啊，对了，{$P$}。我有件事想和您谈谈，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f4075571bfad1e42ff2dfb2a22fb6226a85d9b6acd7e4c3dc36a126a4dfab2e8", "ja": "話したい事……？", "zh": "有话想说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
